UID:69cbc4b31e64afd01e65d6ab@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Acclaimed jazz singer/songwriter Shannon Butcher  celebrates 
 the music of the true north\, strong and free!\nExpect to hear Shannon's s
 ignature style adding a jazz twist to iconic Canadian pop and folk songs\,
  alongside some hidden Canadian jazz gems. Come along with Shannon on a so
 nic tour of Toronto\, from the music of the Palais Royale big band hall to
  the folk coffee houses of Yorkville.\nNo advance registration nor free ti
 ckets required.
