 r 12: Island of the Blue Dolphins by Scott O’Dell\nOctober 3: A Series o
 f Unfortunate Events: The Bad Beginning by Lemony Snicket\nNovember 14: Bo
 rrowers by Mary Norton\nDecember 12: The BFG by Roald Dahl\nJanuary 9 (202
 7): Number the Stars by Lois Lowry\nBecause of Winn-Dixie\nBecause of Winn
 -Dixie
